0..74 Comment "// A resumed stack\'s frames are laid out where the resumption stands, each"
75..151 Comment "// window copied with them: the captured locals move, and every read follows"
152..225 Comment "// them. The move a polled Rust future may not make is the ordinary case."
227..301 Comment "/// The stack resumed under a frame of the clause\'s own, so its frames lie"
302..378 Comment "/// higher than where they were captured; the view still reads its cell, and"
379..441 Comment "/// the clause adds its hundred to the handled answer (#1183)."
